{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ZNSX3b0iY81793680264.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>英王查理斯三世與王后卡米拉，訪問加勒比海島國安提瓜和巴布達期間，出現尷尬場面。</p><p></p><p>兩人出席當地獨立日慶祝活動，現場突然橫風橫雨。卡米拉拿到雨傘後，無理會查理斯三世，先行離開觀禮台。全身濕透的查理斯三世，顯得有點驚訝，轉身問工作人員雨傘在哪，但不久他返回觀禮台。</p><p></p><p>路透社報道，他最終拿到雨傘，並完成檢閱儀仗隊儀式，之後還開玩笑指自己變成「落湯雞」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T06:22:50.034463+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T04:28:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T07:18:21.663674+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T06:18:48.565469+00:00","content_hash":"1ce98545ecd47c9b447a068e3c7a71fbe89f073effad1fe54f77d89bbd099e60","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T06:22:50.034463+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}